{#- Instruction prose of the ICA target view, one section per field. Each section is one unwrapped line, so the rendered field has no line break. -#}
{%- if section == "slot_description" -%}
{{ uca_type }} slot for {{ action }}; copy this slot handle unchanged in the response.
{%- elif section == "route_instruction" -%}
Copy route_handle and obligation_handle unchanged. These references are evidence to consider; they do not force an ICA finding.
{%- elif section == "mechanism_instruction" -%}
Copy mechanism_handle unchanged. A separate check found this known mechanism on the listed path; it does not force an ICA finding, makes no coverage claim, and never replaces the slot's own hazards or routed obligations.
{%- elif section == "copy_handles" -%}
copy each opaque handle unchanged
{%- endif -%}
